From: Bogdan Mircea <mirceapetrebogdan@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] wave: own standalone multicast membership and transport

Restore the standalone querier, membership policy and acknowledged firmware
groups together with AP_VLAN membership retirement and descriptor pins.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: Bogdan Mircea <mirceapetrebogdan@gmail.com>

